    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030020,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "なんでしょう！　何かご用事ですか？\r\nわたしこれから──……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ちょっと、ソファに座ってくれ\r\n話があるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え…………\r\n……は、はい……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──すまん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸に黙って、小糸の家に電話させてもらった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ぴゃ……！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "親御さんと、電話越しだけど少し話したよ\r\n……アイドルのこと、何も言ってなかったんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "017"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸に謝らなきゃならないことがたくさんある\r\nまず、勝手に電話したことがひとつだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "い、いえ……\r\nわたし…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それから、もっと小糸の話を聞くべきだった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "それは、わたしが……\r\nわたしが、嘘、ついてたから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、嘘つかせることになってすまない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………………………",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸の親御さんと、しっかり話さないといけない\r\nでも、その前にひとつ確認したい",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "fade_out"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──小糸はこの後も\r\nアイドル、やりたいか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……………………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "えっと、ですね……\r\n…………最初は",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "やらないとみんなと一緒にいられないから\r\nわたし、またひとりになっちゃうと思って……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──面接しに来てくれた時、最初は正直、\r\n小糸にアイドルは難しいんじゃないかと思った",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど、幼馴染のことを話しだしたら\r\nぱっと明るくなって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あまりにも一生懸命話すからさ、\r\nこっちも笑顔になった",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういう小糸の姿が、\r\n誰かを元気にできると思ったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………っ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸がアイドルを始めてから、\r\n本当に一生懸命レッスンしてたのを見てきた",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつも真面目でひたむきで、\r\n……だからきっとみんな、小糸を応援したくなる",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──小糸は、アイドルに向いてるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "006",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ま、毎日、学校が終わって……みんなでここに来て……\r\nレッスンするの……楽しかったです",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "中学校はみんなと違う学校だったし……\r\n今までわたし、放課後は勉強ばっかりで……",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わたしも、みんなと一緒に……\r\n特別になれたみたいで……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だけどお母さんがいいよって言うわけないから……\r\n楽しくなるほど、言えなくなって…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ごめんなさい、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わたし、ちゃんとした理由とか\r\nどうなりたいかとか、まだ全然無いけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "それでもアイドル、やりたいって\r\n言ってもいいですか……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ああ",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "もちろんだ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "いいよ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "ありがとう",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうと決まれば、小糸からも\r\nちゃんと親御さんに話さないとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だ、\r\n小糸が思ってることを言えばいい",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030240,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………でも",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だめだった時は\r\nまた一緒に考えよう、な？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030250,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………はい\r\nよろしくお願いします……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030250"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいに決まってる\r\nだからちゃんと、親御さんと話してこよう",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一緒にさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030260,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030270,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……\r\nありがとうございます……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030270"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドル、やりたいって言ってくれて",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030280,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それ、親御さんにも伝えてみよう\r\n一緒に行くからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030290,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん\r\n……怒って、ないんですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200103/1022001030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……小糸、大丈夫だ\r\n失敗しても、いいんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001030300,
